{
  "file" : "npc/events/twintowers.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 19,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "[Twin Towers]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 20,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "How are you? We are the Twin Towers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "It is such a pleasure to be able to meet you here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "I suppose you know that this is Ragnarok Online, a land of dreams and fantasies."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Are you having a joyous adventure and exciting experience?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "[Twin Towers]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Although we can't move around and can't live the way you do,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "we love the world as much as you do!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "[Twin Towers]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "May you experience the sensation of this lovely world!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "For this reason, we are here at your service with our special magic."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Kindly let us know."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "I shall accept your offer."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "I'll ask for your service next time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "[Twin Towers]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Er, what a pity. Traveling by yourself is still the best evidence of adventure."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Isn't this proving that you are still young?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "We respect brave hearts like this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "[Twin Towers]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "There are good and bad times in life, moreover, adventure isn't an easy task in the first place."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Isn't this true?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Feel free to come to us when you have time, we will always be there to serve you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "[Twin Towers]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Forget all your troubles, and create a splendid legend in this wonderful world."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "This is such a wonderful world, and you'll always be a great adventurer!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "[Twin Towers]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "The flaming passion of an adventurer,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "The desire to explore the unknown realms,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "The dedication and commitment to achieve the aspiration..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "You are simply a true adventurer with what compassion."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "[Twin Towers]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "We wish to help passionate adventurers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Although we are not able to move, luckily we have the special ability that can warp you to places of danger and excitement."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "[Twin Towers]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Come on! Where do you wish to go?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Just let us know you desired destination and we will send your there!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Hidden Temple"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Orc Dungeon"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Ant Hell"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Mjolnir Waste Pit"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Sphinx"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Twin Towers",
      "text" : "Glast Heim"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
